    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 209]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Provincial Councils and Local Governmenton 26th of September, 2017.\n\n(Published in the Gazette on September 11, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\nPrice : Rs. 12.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nPRADESHIYA SABHA (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of 1987\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause replaces section 4 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No.15 of 1987and the legal effect of the new section as replaced is to amend the composition of thePradeshiya Sabhas.\n\n1Pradeshiya Sabha (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n2\u2014PL 005436\u2014475 (09/2017)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 51/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE PRADESHIYA SABHA ACT, NO. 15 OF 1987\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Pradeshiya Sabha(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 4 of the Pradeshiya Sabha Act, No. 15 of1987 is hereby repealed and the following sectionsubstituted therefor:\u2014\n\n4.(1) Each Pradeshiya Sabha shall consistof such number of members\u2014\n\n(a)as specified by the Minister by Orderpublished in the Gazette, based onthe Orders published under sections3C and 3D of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance (Chapter 262);\n\n(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of members as specified bythe Minister by Order made underparagraph (a), who shall be returnedin terms of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and\n\n(c)determined by the Commissionerunder paragraph (a) of subsection (4)of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262).\n\nShort title.\n\nReplacementof section 4of Act,No. 15 of1987.\n\n\u201cCompositionof PradeshiyaSabhas.\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nPradeshiya Sabha (Amendment)2"
