    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 205]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by the Minister of Foreign Employment and Minister of Justiceon 19th of September, 2017.\n\n(Published in the Gazette on August 21, 2017)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed.\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2\u2014PL 010310\u2014 510 (09/2017)\n\nJUDICATURE (AMENDMENT)\n\nto amend the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2: This clause amends section 4 of the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978 and the legaleffect of the section as amended is to increase the number of judges of the High Court.\n\nJudicature (Amendment)1\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 32/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE JUDICATURE ACT, NO. 2 OF 1978\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Judicature (Amendment)Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 4 of the Judicature Act, No. 2 of 1978 is herebyamended by the repeal of paragraph (a) of that section andthe substitution therefor of the following paragraph:\u2014\n\n\u201c(a) not less than ten and not more than eighty five judges,each of whom shall be known as a \u201cJudge of theHigh Court;\u201d.\n\n3.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\nSinhala text toprevail in caseofinconsistency.\n\nAmendment ofsection 4 of Act,No. 2 of 1978.\n\nJudicature (Amendment)2\n\nAnnual subscription of English Bills and Acts of the Parliament Rs. 885 (Local), Rs. 1,180(Foreign), payable to the Superintendent, Government Publications Bureau, Department ofGovernment Information, No. 163, Kirulapona Mawatha, Polhengoda, Colombo 05 before 15thDecember each year in respect of the year following."
