    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of September 08, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 11.09.2017)\n\nMUNICIPAL COUNCILS (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Provincial Councils andLocal Government\n\nto amend the Municipal Councils Ordinance (Chapter 252)\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause replaces section 5 of the Municipal Councils Ordinance (Chapter252) and the legal effect of the new section as replaced is to amend the composition of theMunicipal Councils.\n\n1Municipal Councils (Amendment)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n2\u2014PL 005434\u2014475 (09/2017)\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 49/2017\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE MUNICIPAL COUNCILS ORDINANCE (CHAPTER 252)\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Municipal Councils(Amendment) Act, No. of 2017.\n\n2.Section 5 of the Municipal Councils Ordinance(Chapter 252) is hereby repealed and the following sectionsubstituted therefor:\u2014\n\n5.(1) Each Municipal Council shallconsist of such number of Councillors\u2014\n\n(a)as specified by the Minister by Orderpublished in the Gazette, based onthe Orders published under sections3C and 3D of the Local AuthoritiesElections Ordinance (Chapter 262);\n\n(b)equivalent to forty per centum of thenumber of Councillors as specifiedby the Minister by Order made underparagraph (a), who shall be returnedin terms of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262); and\n\n(c)determined by the Commissionerunder paragraph (a) of subsection (4)of section 65B of the LocalAuthorities Elections Ordinance(Chapter 262).\n\nShort title.\n\nReplacementof section 5of Chapter252.\n\n\u201cCompositionof MunicipalCouncils.\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nMunicipal Councils (Amendment)2"
