    "chunk_text": "2.(1) From and after the date of commencement of thisAct, such and so may persons as now are members of the \u201cAbdulMajeed Academy\u201d (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAcademy\u201d) orshall hereafter be admitted as members of the Corporation herebyconstituted, shall be a body corporate with perpetual succession,under the name and style of the \u201cAbdul Majeed Academy\u201d,(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cCorporation\u201d) and by that namemay sue and be sued, with full power and authority to have anduse a common seal and to alter the same at its pleasure.\n\nShort title.\n\nPreamble.\n\nIncorporationof the AbdulMajeedAcademy.\n\n25\n\n2Abdul Majeed Academy(Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n3.(1) The general objects for which the Corporation isconstituted are hereby declared to be\u2014\n\n(a) to function as a fully-fledged higher educationalinstitution;\n\n(b) to offer lingual, technical, information technologyand theological subjects;\n\n(c) to conduct short-term and long-term courses onvarious disciplines;\n\n(d) to conduct special and occasional lectures on topicalissues;\n\n(e) to motivate research, literature and writing;\n\n(f) to publish books and periodicals giving guidelineson day-to-day affairs of the masses;\n\n(g) to conduct guidance programmes;\n\n(h) to provide counselling services on matters affectingthe personal, family and social life;\n\n(i) to propagate noble moral values; and\n\n(j) to initiate, promote,facilitate and participate indevelopment and advancement of education.\n\n(2) In the implementation of the objects specified insubsection (1) the Corporation shall ensure that suchimplementation shall be carried out without anydiscrimination based on race, religion, language, caste,sex, political opinion, place of birth or any of suchgrounds.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\nAbdul Majeed Academy(Incorporation)3\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25"
