    "chunk_text": "THE GAZETTE OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nPart II of May 19, 2017\n\nSUPPLEMENT\n\n(Issued on 22. 05. 2017)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 6.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nSUGATHADASA NATIONAL SPORTS COMPLEXAUTHORITY (AMENDMENT)\n\nOrdered to be published by the Minister of Sports\n\nto amend the Sugathadasa National Sports Complex AuthorityAct, No. 17 of 1999\n\nSTATEMENT OF LEGAL EFFECT\n\nClause 2 : This clause amends the Long Title to the Sugathadasa National Sports ComplexAuthority Act, No. 17 of 1999, (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d) bywidening the scope of the powers of the Sugathadasa National Sports Complex Authority(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cAuthority\u201d).\n\nClause 3 : This clause introduces a new section 2A to the principal enactment specifyingthe objects of the Authority.\n\nClause 4 : This clause amends section 3 of the principal enactment by providing for theappointment of the Working Director of the Authority.\n\nClause 5 : This clause amends section 4 of the principal enactment widening the scopeof the functions of the Authority.\n\nClause 6 : This clause amends section 5 of the principal enactment empowering theAuthority to achieve its objects.\n\nClause 7 : This clause amends the Schedule to the principal enactment, and it isconsequential to the amendment made to the principal enactment by clause 4 of this Act.\n\n1Sugathadasa National Sports ComplexAuthority (Amendment)\n\n2\u2014PL 005172\u2014 475 (04/2017)\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\nL.D.\u2014O. 62/2016.\n\nAN ACT TO AMEND THE SUGATHADASA NATIONAL SPORTS COMPLEXAUTHORITY ACT, NO. 17 OF 1999\n\nBE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sugathadasa NationalSports Complex Authority (Amendment) Act, No. of 2017."
