    "chunk_text": "3Hector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\n30\n\n(k)to design and implement social mobilizationprogrammes for the development of children andwomen and implementing education and trainingprogrammes for this purpose;\n\n(m)to provide training necessary for young men andwomen engaged in agriculture and guiding themtowards export crops cultivation, organizing localand foreign marketing activities necessary for it,and providing space necessary for cultivation;\n\n(n)to provide assistance in times of natural disasters,emergencies and accidents;\n\n(o)to provide training in fields of engineering,technology, carpentry, masonry and computing toyoung men and women who do not get access forhigher education and directing them towards suchvocations and starting training centres necessaryfor it;\n\n(p)to do all or several such other acts and things as arenecessary for and incidental or conducive to theattainment of the above objects.\n\n4.Subject to the provisions of this Act and any otherwritten law, the Corporation shall have the power to do,perform and execute all such acts and matters as necessary ordesirable for the promotion or furtherance of the objects ofthe Corporation or any one of them, including the power:\u2014\n\n(a)to raise funds and receive grants, gifts or donations,in cash or kind;\n\nPowers of theCorporation.\n\n4Hector Appuhamy Helping Hand Charity Foundation (Incorporation)\n\n(b)to acquire, in any manner whatsoever and hold, takeor give on lease or hire, rent, sell or otherwise disposeof, any movable or immovable property andconstruct, maintain and alter any buildings or worksnecessary or convenient for the business of theCorporation;\n\n(c)to make, draw, accept, discount, endorse, negotiate,buy, sell and issue bills of exchange, cheques,promissory notes and other negotiable instrumentsand to open, operate and close bank accounts andborrow or raise money with or without security;"
