    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nCHAMBER OF CONSTRUCTION INDUSTRY OFSRI LANKA (INCORPORATION)\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 152]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. (Prof.) Ashu Marasinghe , M. P. on 30th November, 2016\n\n(Published in the Gazette on November 15, 2016)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nto incorporate the Chamber of Construction Industry of Sri Lanka\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\n2-2dp\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n1Chamber of Construction Industry ofSri Lanka (Incorporation)\n\nPreamble.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE CHAMBER OF CONSTRUCTIONINDUSTRY OF SRI LANKA\n\nWHEREAS an Chamber called and known as the \u201cChamberof Construction Industry of Sri Lanka\u201d has heretofore beenformed for the purpose of effectually carrying out its objectsand transacting all matters connected with the said Chamberaccording to the rules agreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Chamber has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was established, and has applied tobe incorporated and it will be expedient to grant the saidapplication :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Chamber of ConstructionIndustry of Sri Lanka (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016."
  },
