    "chunk_size_bytes": 1560,
    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 148]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nPresented by Hon. Mayantha Dissanayake M. P. for Kandy Districton 11th November, 2016\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 24, 2016)\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\n2-2d\n\n2-\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\nSRI LANKA INSURANCE INSTITUTE\n\n(INCORPORATION)\n\nto incorporate the Sri Lanka Insurance Institute\n\nPrice : Rs. 26.00Postage : Rs. 20.00\n\n1Sri Lanka Insurance Institute\n\n(Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 010158\u2014 300 (08/2016)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE SRI LANKA INSURANCE INSTITUTE\n\nWHEREAS an association of insurance professionals calledand known as the \u201cSri Lanka Insurance Institute\u201d hasheretofore been established for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all matters connected with thesaid institute according to the constitution agreed to by itsmembers:\n\nAND WHEREAS the said association together with itsCouncil has heretofore successfully carried out andtransacted the several objects and matters for which it wasestablished, and has applied to be incorporated, and it willbe for the public advantage to grant the said application.\n\nBE it therefore enacted by Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Sri Lanka InsuranceInstitute (Incorporation) Act, No. of 2016."
  },
