    "chunk_text": "PARLIAMENT OF THE DEMOCRATICSOCIALIST REPUBLIC OFSRI LANKA\n\nMAITHRIPALA SIRISENA LAKDARU DIRIYAFOUNDATION (INCORPORATION)\n\nA\n\nBILL\n\nPresented by Hon. Malith Jayathilake , M. P.on 25th October, 2016\n\nOrdered by Parliament to be printed\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA\n\nTO BE PURCHASED AT THE GOVERNMENT PUBLICATIONS BUREAU, COLOMBO 5\n\nPrice : Rs. 8.00Postage : Rs. 10.00\n\nto incorporate the Maithripala Sirisena Lakdaru Diriya Foundation\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n[Bill No. 145]\n\n\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\u2014\n\n(Published in the Gazette on October 10, 2016)\n\n1 Maithripala Sirisena Lakdaru DiriyaFoundation (Incorporation)\n\n2\u2014PL 010235\u2014 300 (10/2016)\n\nPreamble.\n\nShort title.\n\nGeneralobjects of theCorporation.\n\n5\n\n10\n\n15\n\n20\n\n25\n\nAN ACT TO INCORPORATE THE MAITHRIPALA SIRISENA LAKDARUDIRIYA FOUNDATION\n\nWHEREAS An association called and known as \u201cMaithripalaSirisena Lakdaru Diriya Foundation\u201d has heretofore beenformed in Polonnaruwa for the purpose of effectuallycarrying out and transacting all objects and mattersconnected with the said Foundation according to the rulesagreed to by its members :\n\nAND WHEREAS the said Association has heretoforesuccessfully carried out and transacted the several objectsand matters for which it was formed and has applied to beincorporated and it will be for the public advantage to grantsuch application :\n\nBE it therefore enacted by the Parliament of the DemocraticSocialist Republic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014\n\n1.This Act may be cited as the Maithripala SirisenaLakdaru Diriya Foundation (Incorporation) Act, No. of2016."
